From: =?UTF-8?q?Juan=20Manuel=20L=C3=B3pez=20Carrillo?=
 <juanmanuellopezcarrillo@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 18:52:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 121/143] phy: allwinner: inno-combophy: undo subsystem init on
 provider failure
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

If devm_of_phy_provider_register() fails, probe returned with the
sub-system fully brought up by pcie_usb3_sub_system_init(): regulator
enabled, resets deasserted, clocks prepared and enabled, initialized
set.  Nothing ever undid that on this path, so the clocks and the
regulator stayed on forever and the subsequent devm clk_put() ran on
still-enabled clocks.

Unwind through pcie_usb3_sub_system_exit() before propagating the
error; it is the exact mirror of the init and already guards against
double invocation with the initialized flag.

Signed-off-by: Juan Manuel López Carrillo <juanmanuellopezcarrillo@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: AI Agent
---
 drivers/phy/allwinner/sunxi-inno-combophy.c | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/allwinner/sunxi-inno-combophy.c b/drivers/phy/allwinner/sunxi-inno-combophy.c
index ea2495044..4aabb17ff 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/allwinner/sunxi-inno-combophy.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/allwinner/sunxi-inno-combophy.c
@@ -1077,8 +1077,10 @@ static int sunxi_combphy_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	phy_set_drvdata(combphy->phy, combphy);
 
 	phy_provider = devm_of_phy_provider_register(dev, sunxi_combphy_xlate);
-	if (IS_ERR(phy_provider))
-		return PTR_ERR(phy_provider);
+	if (IS_ERR(phy_provider)) {
+		ret = PTR_ERR(phy_provider);
+		goto err_sub_system_exit;
+	}
 
 	combphy->pwr_nb.notifier_call = sunxi_inno_combophy_power_event;
 	/* register inno power notifier */
@@ -1089,6 +1091,11 @@ static int sunxi_combphy_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	pm_runtime_get_sync(dev);
 
 	return 0;
+
+err_sub_system_exit:
+	pcie_usb3_sub_system_exit(pdev);
+
+	return ret;
 }
 
 static void sunxi_combphy_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
